", "id": "2828956927483990", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_2828956930817323_589672073038431333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ja_6ZIkn_AQQ7kNvwHqBfq1&_nc_oc=Adr5OByrmwtcqiu5CZTRx08AuGo00Y-3UBtziEeJsRKKtckqonjrdtS8b97cZNJfoaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSud7pTTSn4Qt2C9znBvCL3x_uSzT56hN8GQxXfhPfdhQ&oe=6AEC93B0"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-2-playing.png", "id": "1754014090065974", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1754014093399307_279176435794436414_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=URn8-Jvaa8EQ7kNvwH0qs-b&_nc_oc=Adr6CFPy1djLEWqhBRtGZNISZGxNgt7SiJBb_EgXQhl1CGzkHpS5lDQmUXdF6I8st78&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzlx5ZhL6jteOmesEeLYxj8ybRmvLoHW8oElX4di6GiQ&oe=6AEC85BC"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-3-series.png", "id": "1404211985204123", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1404211988537456_3185832738215004774_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eoubwBhHV8cQ7kNvwHdnMDx&_nc_oc=AdoNBzVQDCrEuYj_mgS-QboPBKDAY2ZOUhKw25REi366d5bcJlyCbapdkJqP374uii8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTIS72rQdQ7y2IR0zZGQqMLW14M9H81LhzlFVOaI8uMmw&oe=6AEC965F"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-4-environment-station.png", "id": "982933147479863", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825575_982933150813196_1098495751667877981_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sZvcLZhCQ1wQ7kNvwFeU5O4&_nc_oc=AdofulH3TKQa4fys3fvK0vqofpLSw6PW9zTiKwV98D_Rod0KSd0ZVxOAO2BYvgvT630&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSruhyJdwohbLtYsqiOb_fNBQnL26POrvawEutGaiiRGQ&oe=6AEC920A"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-environment-cabin.png", "id": "1524763559413134", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300725_1524763562746467_764910693733824437_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zyGgpzuYlysQ7kNvwG2Ln4W&_nc_oc=AdpdwtjpnXY8umyZ8HdTz5Ez4qP-FRNb94-vMlFdJBPDurLtCgIHaL592DLrNZ2CHRU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQOIr4FA3Pqqd959cDwGdcGBMefEflxUddWPgmRQtXoOA&oe=6AECB981"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "JellyTheatre", "keywords": ["jellyfin", "media", "movie"], "long_description": "JellyTheatre turns your Meta Quest into a private cinema for your Jellyfin\nmedia server. Sign in with a Quick Connect code (no typing), pick a film and\nwatch it on a giant screen.\n\nPLACES TO WATCH\n- A movie theatre with dimming lights and a screen that lights up the room\n- A home cinema, a lakeside cabin with a crackling fire, the Cupola of a space\n  station floating above the planet, a dark void\n- Your own room in passthrough, with a screen you can place anywhere\n\nYOUR LIBRARY, IN SYNC\n- Continue watching, next up, new movies and shows, favourites, search\n- Seasons and episodes with thumbnails and watched marks\n- Your progress and watched status go back to Jellyfin, so you can pick up on\n  any other device\n\nGENTLE ON YOUR SERVER\n- Plays your files directly whenever the headset can, so your server doesn't\n  have to convert them\n- Shows whether a film plays directly or is being converted\n\nMADE FOR WATCHING\n- Subtitles (text and Blu-ray PGS) with size, style, position and timing\n- Skip intro and credits, chapters, seek bar previews, up-next episodes\n\nREQUIREMENTS\n- A Jellyfin server reachable over HTTPS\n- A Jellyfin account on that server\n\nJellyTheatre is an independent project, not affiliated with the Jellyfin\nproject. It does not provide any content: it plays the media on your own\nserver.\n\nScreenshots show Blender Foundation open movies (Tears of Steel, Sintel,\nCaminandes and others), CC BY, \u00a9 Blender Foundation, studio.blender.org.", "short_description": "Watch your own Jellyfin library on a giant screen: a movie theatre, a home cinema, a lakeside cabin